Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:18:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add calendar month grid and occurrence projection

Project the occurrences of a month with the same getNextPaymentDayAfter
rules the Upcoming screen uses, so monthly clamping and the inclusive
endDate stay consistent. The grid is pure and padded to full weeks,
including adjacent-month days. First day of week is derived from a
BCP-47 tag instead of expect/actual so it can be unit tested.
